      "content": "The idea that your absence would bring relief is a dangerous illusion your pain is feeding you. It's not about logic; it's about the crushing weight of your current suffering, and that weight is so heavy it makes letting go seem like the only sensible option. But that relief you imagine is just the silence of an ending, not a true peace. Please, just give yourself one more chance to feel something other than this crushing despair.",
